Subject: [PATCH 24/36] Correct the note about api.md: it exists, and it agrees
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

I claimed examples/server/api.md was absent at the pinned commit. It is
there, and on every field this contract touches it says the same thing
the parser does — a third independent confirmation rather than a
contradiction.

It is still not the authority, and the reason is visible in it:
sample_params.extra_sample_args is read by from_json_str and documented
nowhere in api.md. The docs are incomplete rather than wrong, which is
the failure mode that quietly costs a feature instead of causing a bug.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmpuZqpQrFjas3Ajv22pKb
